# RULE: pipeline scripts and project documentation are COMMITTED, never ignored.
#
# An earlier version of this file ignore-listed the project's own tooling —
# sync-brands.sh, sync-brands-from-github.py, link-checker.js, BRAND-SYNC.md,
# WORKFLOW.md, DEPLOYMENT.md and the brand-tracking CSVs. Because they were never
# committed, they were lost permanently when the working copy went stale.
# WORKFLOW.md and DEPLOYMENT.md were only recoverable because a single commit
# (782ff9d^) happened to contain them before the ignore rule took effect.
#
# Only ignore things that are regenerable, machine-local, or secret.

# Dependencies
node_modules/
package-lock.json

# Environment variables — never commit real values; .env.example IS committed
.env
.env.local

# Netlify
.netlify/

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Editor files
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# Temporary files
*.tmp
.cache/
server.pid

# Scratch copies of the database (the real one, bags.json, is committed)
bags-backup.json
bags-temp.json
test-load.html

# Scratch copies of pages
brands.html.backup
brands_temp.html

# Machine-generated scan output
images/badge-scan.txt
link-check-results.json
